{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位重點提要｜10月22日\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MAG-PROMO-261022.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】建造業總工會公布新一年度薪酬調整安排，絕大部分工種都要凍薪。究竟建造業前景如何？政府可以做些甚麼幫助業界提升競爭力？</p><p>周四的時事全方位，請來工會代表分享。</p><p>題目：建造業前景與工人薪酬</p><p>熱線電話：1833298</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:40:52.463095+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T17:38:18.604228+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:38:18.604228+00:00","content_hash":"575d80e447081c034d4ee69fb37b80861dbd1a53bbc2f2e4f427320b832558b3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}